{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MasterRunners is a free-to-play multiplayer hand based movement game surrounding a variety of entertaining gamemodes, cosmetics, obstacles, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over <strong>10+ gamemodes</strong>, we guarantee this game is worth your time. We have lots to offer, so what are you waiting for!?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you can do:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Gamemodes with players across the <strong>WORLD</strong>. MasterRunners can be played worldwide and with our <strong>advanced multiplayer system</strong>, you can enjoy multiplayer &amp; have a very fun time. For the gamemodes, we build special gamemodes that have never been used in others games making us stand out and more fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652080/extras/8c4ab0e66a80a5ae53560706c3ea0754.avif?t=1770523757\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652080/extras_big/8c4ab0e66a80a5ae53560706c3ea0754.avif?t=1770523757 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill with friends and have a <strong>great time.</strong> With areas such as the &quot;Main Hub&quot;, you can relax and have a calming time with buddies as you talk to your hearts desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652080/extras/b02f79018d4ea282185a75dba593eac3.avif?t=1770523757\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652080/extras_big/b02f79018d4ea282185a75dba593eac3.avif?t=1770523757 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop for new cosmetics at Gregson's Shop with the free in-game currency... Energy! Using energy, you can get all kinds of cosmetics of any type just with one click. This is how you can customize your character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652080/extras/02791f3b8751042899440390549214a1.avif?t=1770523757\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652080/extras_big/02791f3b8751042899440390549214a1.avif?t=1770523757 width=1560 height=770 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is lots to do in MasterRunners, so check it out <strong>TODAY!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652080/extras/362f72f2d1bc958a784b4ad1ec002640.avif?t=1770523757\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652080/extras_big/362f72f2d1bc958a784b4ad1ec002640.avif?t=1770523757 width=1560 height=974 /></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3652080?t=1770523757","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3652080?t=1770523757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652080/3d7106f76445ca0e6d34f181bc95791c714e3e12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770523757","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652080/3d7106f76445ca0e6d34f181bc95791c714e3e12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770523757","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":nul